     The eellffttcc__ttiimmeessttaammpp() function may fail with the following errors:

     [EINVAL]  SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH contains invalid characters.

     [ERANGE]  SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH specifies a negative value or a value that
               cannot be stored in a time_t.
     The eellffttcc__ttiimmeessttaammpp() function may also fail for any of the reasons de‐
